{"id":"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-gale-stewart.md","title":"Gale–Stewart 博弈与策略","display":"df-gale-stewart — Gale–Stewart 博弈与策略","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-gale-stewart","aliases":["20-df-gale-stewart"],"display":"df-gale-stewart — Gale–Stewart 博弈与策略","chapter":"15","section":"15.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§15.1 的博弈定义","source_pdf_pages":[246],"source_printed_pages":[217],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-gale-stewart"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-gale-stewart</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gale-stewart — Gale–Stewart 博弈与策略"},{"key":"chapter","html":"15"},{"key":"section","html":"15.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§15.1 的博弈定义"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>246</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>217</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,II\">\\(I,II\\)</span> 是两个不同的玩家标签；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{I,II\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{I,II\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>。策略的定义域由下述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_i\">\\(H_i\\)</span> 给出，游戏数据按有序元组表示。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<p>固定本书策略代码所采用的可计算双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_I:\\omega\\to H_I\">\\(q_I:\\omega\\to H_I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_{II}:\\omega\\to H_{II}\">\\(q_{II}:\\omega\\to H_{II}\\)</span> 及其逆；可计算性按串代码解释。这两个枚举是环境参数，不要求更换已有枚举。原始策略候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times2\">\\(s\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times2\\)</span>，允许部分函数候选；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Win}_i\">\\(\\operatorname{Win}_i\\)</span> 中的全函数守卫要求策略在全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_i\">\\(H_i\\)</span> 上取二值。策略代码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 的类型为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\to2\">\\(\\omega\\to2\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gale\\text{-}stewart}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nH_I:=\\{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:|\\sigma|\\equiv0\\pmod2\\},\\quad\nH_{II}:=\\{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:|\\sigma|\\equiv1\\pmod2\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{turn}(n):=\\begin{cases}I&amp;n\\equiv0\\pmod2,\\\\II&amp;n\\equiv1\\pmod2,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nG(A):=(2^{&lt;\\omega},2^\\omega,\\operatorname{turn},A,2^\\omega\\setminus A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Follows}_i(X,s)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ [X\\upharpoonright n\\in H_i\\Rightarrow (X\\upharpoonright n,X(n))\\in s],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\ns\\in2^{H_I}\\land\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{Follows}_I(X,s)\\Rightarrow X\\in A],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Win}_{II}(s,A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\ns\\in2^{H_{II}}\\land\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{Follows}_{II}(X,s)\\Rightarrow X\\notin A].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gale\\text{-}stewart}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nH_I:=\\{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:|\\sigma|\\equiv0\\pmod2\\},\\quad\nH_{II}:=\\{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:|\\sigma|\\equiv1\\pmod2\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{turn}(n):=\\begin{cases}I&amp;n\\equiv0\\pmod2,\\\\II&amp;n\\equiv1\\pmod2,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nG(A):=(2^{&lt;\\omega},2^\\omega,\\operatorname{turn},A,2^\\omega\\setminus A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Follows}_i(X,s)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ [X\\upharpoonright n\\in H_i\\Rightarrow (X\\upharpoonright n,X(n))\\in s],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\ns\\in2^{H_I}\\land\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{Follows}_I(X,s)\\Rightarrow X\\in A],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Win}_{II}(s,A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\ns\\in2^{H_{II}}\\land\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{Follows}_{II}(X,s)\\Rightarrow X\\notin A].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\nq_i^{-1}(h)=n\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ q_i(n)=h\n\\quad(i\\in\\{I,II\\},\\ h\\in H_i,\\ n\\in\\omega),\\\\\ns_{i,g}:=\\{(h,g(q_i^{-1}(h))):h\\in H_i\\}\\quad(g\\in2^\\omega),\\\\\n\\operatorname{StrategyCode}_i(s):=\\{(n,s(q_i(n))):n\\in\\omega\\}\\quad(s\\in2^{H_i}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Follows}_i(X,g)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Follows}_i(X,s_{i,g})\n\\quad(X,g\\in2^\\omega),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Win}_i(g,A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Win}_i(s_{i,g},A)\n\\quad(g\\in2^\\omega,\\ A\\subseteq2^\\omega).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\nq_i^{-1}(h)=n\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ q_i(n)=h\n\\quad(i\\in\\{I,II\\},\\ h\\in H_i,\\ n\\in\\omega),\\\\\ns_{i,g}:=\\{(h,g(q_i^{-1}(h))):h\\in H_i\\}\\quad(g\\in2^\\omega),\\\\\n\\operatorname{StrategyCode}_i(s):=\\{(n,s(q_i(n))):n\\in\\omega\\}\\quad(s\\in2^{H_i}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Follows}_i(X,g)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Follows}_i(X,s_{i,g})\n\\quad(X,g\\in2^\\omega),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Win}_i(g,A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Win}_i(s_{i,g},A)\n\\quad(g\\in2^\\omega,\\ A\\subseteq2^\\omega).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>策略是对该玩家全部有限局面的函数；策略集合不是合法 play 的集合。每一步恰添一位，与 BM 的任意长延伸不同。</p>\n<p>来源：§15.1 的博弈定义；印刷页 217；PDF 第 246 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"I,II","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\{I,II\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"H_i","display":false},{"tex":"q_I:\\omega\\to H_I","display":false},{"tex":"q_{II}:\\omega\\to H_{II}","display":false},{"tex":"s\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}\\times2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Win}_i","display":false},{"tex":"H_i","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\to2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gale\\text{-}stewart}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nH_I:=\\{\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}:|\\sigma|\\equiv0\\pmod2\\},\\quad\nH_{II}:=\\{\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}:|\\sigma|\\equiv1\\pmod2\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{turn}(n):=\\begin{cases}I&n\\equiv0\\pmod2,\\\\II&n\\equiv1\\pmod2,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nG(A):=(2^{<\\omega},2^\\omega,\\operatorname{turn},A,2^\\omega\\setminus A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Follows}_i(X,s)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ [X\\upharpoonright n\\in H_i\\Rightarrow (X\\upharpoonright n,X(n))\\in s],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\ns\\in2^{H_I}\\land\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{Follows}_I(X,s)\\Rightarrow X\\in A],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Win}_{II}(s,A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\ns\\in2^{H_{II}}\\land\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{Follows}_{II}(X,s)\\Rightarrow X\\notin A].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\nq_i^{-1}(h)=n\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ q_i(n)=h\n\\quad(i\\in\\{I,II\\},\\ h\\in H_i,\\ n\\in\\omega),\\\\\ns_{i,g}:=\\{(h,g(q_i^{-1}(h))):h\\in H_i\\}\\quad(g\\in2^\\omega),\\\\\n\\operatorname{StrategyCode}_i(s):=\\{(n,s(q_i(n))):n\\in\\omega\\}\\quad(s\\in2^{H_i}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Follows}_i(X,g)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Follows}_i(X,s_{i,g})\n\\quad(X,g\\in2^\\omega),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Win}_i(g,A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Win}_i(s_{i,g},A)\n\\quad(g\\in2^\\omega,\\ A\\subseteq2^\\omega).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":2739,"backlinks":[{"id":"3225aa77bce6f46a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。"},{"id":"efc26dd0829b9c99","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。"},{"id":"d9de3791ae9122ae","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-principal-filter]]。"},{"id":"8372f8b6f584a62e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-lem-open-winning-certificate]]；see [[20-df-closed-winning-strategies]]；see [[20-thm-low-basis]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]。"},{"id":"f917b5